---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About | ARTPHASE">
  <section class="about shell">
    <p class="eyebrow">About ARTPHASE</p>

    <h1>Engineering ideas.<br />Built from real-world experience.</h1>

    <div>
      <p>
        ARTPHASE is an independent engineering knowledge platform focused on
        industrial electrical engineering, motor control, VFD applications,
        power quality, control panels and practical design challenges.
      </p>

      <p>
        The goal is simple: document practical investigations, calculations,
        technical observations and lessons learned from real-world engineering
        work — and turn them into useful references for engineers, designers
        and technical professionals.
      </p>

      <p>
        Topics include motor control, VFDs, soft starters, harmonic mitigation,
        electrical distribution, industrial control panels, protection,
        troubleshooting and other areas of industrial electrical engineering.
      </p>

      <p>
        ARTPHASE is created and maintained by Ramin Tavakoli, an electrical
        engineering professional with extensive experience in industrial
        electrical systems, control panels and automation.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>